-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">谢长丽律师围绕新规的核心要点，从</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">六个维度</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">展开深入讲解：在社会保险管理方面，详细阐述了劳动关系的区分与用工模式的应用；就劳动合同管理问题，通过讲述劳动碰瓷及三期女职工的案例，讲述劳动用工赔偿与劳动合同的延续；针对劳动合同终止和解除情形，系统梳理了新规下的操作规范和风险防范措施；关于员工竞业限制，深入分析了适用范围的调整和补偿标准的优化；对于关联及混同用工问题，提供了切实可行的合规建议；最后，谢律师特别强调了员工的诚实信用义务，指导企业如何有效维护自身合法权益。</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 15px;transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 40%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;height: auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 5px;border-color: rgb(233, 194, 152);box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LgZo7aYxTIN2v7KbAV7xIPShkDiaR8dF3TvNlxOGjRFdUjDWZ7YQqd5RrY35oDgshBc8hPxcG4Mhw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"1.2903225806451613\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"558\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(0.775) / 1; width: 233px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd